<MessageStudioText
	Format="1.2" xmlns="nintendo:msgstudio">
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d29r0101_workman2_00"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おう！　トレーナー！▼
この　トロッコに　のれるように
みんな　がんばって　ほってるよ！▼
だもんで　ちょっと　まってくれ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T10:46:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T10:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おう！　トレーナー！▼
この　トロッコに　乗れるように
みんな　がんばって　掘ってるよ！▼
だもんで　ちょっと　待ってくれ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T10:48:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T10:43:57" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・クリア前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T10:39:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WORKMAN2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T10:38:45" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d29r0101_workman2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おう！　トレーナー
この　トロッコに　のるかい？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T10:39:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おう！　トレーナー
この　トロッコに　乗るかい？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T10:39:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・クリア後
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
　はい　→workman2_02
　いいえ→workman2_03</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T10:42:45" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WORKMAN2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-14T03:52:00" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d29r0101_workman2_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おう！
レッツゴー　トロッコ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-14T03:53:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-14T03:53:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おう！
レッツゴー　トロッコ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-14T03:53:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-14T03:53:57" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい選択時
　トロッコのデモへ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T10:42:40" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WORKMAN2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-14T03:54:05" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d29r0101_workman2_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おう！　のりたくなったら
いつでも　こえを　かけてよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T10:39:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-14T03:53:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おう！　乗りたくなったら
いつでも　声を　かけてよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T10:40:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-14T03:53:57" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・いいえ選択時</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-14T03:54:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WORKMAN2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-14T03:54:05" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d29r0101_stop1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ほる！　とにかくほる！
ヤーコンロードを　ほりまくる！▼
というわけで　きながに
かいつうを　まっててくれるかな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T11:05:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T10:43:50" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ほる！　とにかく掘る！
ヤーコンロードを　掘りまくる！▼
というわけで　気長に
開通を　待っててくれるかな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T11:21:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T10:43:56" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・GRIDX＝5、GRIDZ＝14
・クリア前
※できれば岩も配置してください</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T11:04:12" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WORKMAN2
・ストッパー１</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T11:28:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff00</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d29r0101_stop1_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>はあ……！　とにかくほって
ほりまくってるが……▼
あんた！　いわくだき　を
おぼえた　ポケモンは　いるかい？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T04:00:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T10:43:56" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>はあ……！　とにかく掘って
掘りまくってるが……▼
あんた！　いわくだき　を
覚えた　ポケモンは　いるかい？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T04:01:01" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T10:43:56" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・クリア後
・いわくだきを覚えたポケモンが
　いる　→stop1_03
　いない→stop1_05</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T11:23:23" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WORKMAN2
・ストッパー１</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T11:28:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff00</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d29r0101_stop1_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>よし！　みんなの　ちからを
あわせりゃ　どんな　いわも！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T11:11:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T11:10:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>よし！　みんなの　力を
あわせりゃ　どんな　岩も！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T11:21:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T11:18:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・メッセージ表示後、画面暗転
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T11:18:34" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WORKMAN2
・ストッパー１</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T11:28:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff00</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d29r0101_stop1_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ばんざーい！
ばんざーい！　ばんざーい！▼
よし！　これで
ネジやまと　つながったな！▼
では　トロッコたんとうに　れんらくして
われらは　かえると　するか！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T11:22:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T11:18:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ばんざーい！
ばんざーい！　ばんざーい！▼
よし！　これで
ネジ山と　つながったな！▼
では　トロッコ担当に　連絡して
われらは　帰ると　するか！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T11:22:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T11:18:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・メッセージ表示後、作業員退場
・画面外に消えると主人公操作可能に</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T11:23:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WORKMAN2
・ストッパー１</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T11:28:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff00</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d29r0101_stop1_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そうか……　あんたの　ポケモン
いわくだきを　おぼえていないか……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T11:21:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T11:18:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そうか……　あんたの　ポケモン
いわくだきを　覚えていないか……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-22T08:08:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T11:18:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・いない</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-10T11:23:00" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WORKMAN2
・ストッパー１</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
